From 6c7142d83ea913f2017bd0c601ca2de57f665656 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 02:38:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 41/42] The Move Reminder for free, and a second one in
 Cherrygrove

Blackthorn City's Move Maniac no longer asks for a Heart Scale, and his first
meeting goes straight on to choosing a Pokemon. A woman in Cherrygrove City's
Pokemon Center does the same from the first town on. Made by
tools/hack/move_reminder.py.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEYSk2h6k1E1jWo3cHd
